 # Decision log
 
+## 2026-10-28: Hourly rentals
+
+- **Context:** Visitors sometimes need equipment for only part of a day. The rental desk must support
+  short rentals without changing existing whole-day rates.
+- **Decision:** Equipment may optionally declare an hourly price in integer euro cents. Periods shorter
+  than 24 hours must start and end on UTC hour boundaries and cost hourly price multiplied by elapsed
+  hours; they are invalid when the item has no hourly price. Whole-day periods retain daily pricing and
+  the existing long-rental discount.
+- **Consequences:** Hourly quotes and bookings use the same interval overlap rules as daily reservations.
+  Hourly rentals do not qualify for the three-day discount.
+
